### listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### listar con paginacion y busqueda
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal?limit=5&search=la paz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### crear
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sucursal Central",
    "direccion": "Av. 16 de Julio #1234",
    "telefono": "2201234",
    "ciudad": "La Paz"
}

### crear sin telefono (opcional)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sucursal Sur",
    "direccion": "Calle 21 de Calacoto #45",
    "ciudad": "La Paz"
}

### crear con datos invalidos (espera 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "",
    "telefono": "123456789012345678901234567890"
}

### mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### mostrar inexistente (espera 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sucursal Central Actualizada",
    "direccion": "Av. Camacho #567",
    "telefono": "2205678",
    "ciudad": "La Paz"
}

